{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:0.2", "PA_ja_274:0.3"], "en": "The Collection of Threes, Chapter on the Well (Udapānavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:0.4"], "en": "4. The Lolajātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:1.1", "PA_ja_274:1.2"], "en": "“The crane, the crested one, the thief, the great-grandfather of Laṅkā.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:1.3"], "en": "\"Come here soon, Balāka;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:1.4"], "en": "my friend the crow is fierce.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:2.1"], "en": "\"I am not Balāka, I am a peahen.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:2.2"], "en": "\"I am a greedy crow;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:2.3"], "en": "having failed to follow your advice,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:2.4"], "en": "see how I have returned shorn.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:3.1"], "en": "“Will you obtain wealth again, my dear,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:3.2"], "en": "for such is your virtue?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:3.3"], "en": "For human riches— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:3.4"], "en": "“They enjoy their food together with the birds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_274:4.1"], "en": "The *Lolajātaka*, the fourth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
